        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CL1580, Solid Brass Colonial Style Cabinet Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet latch is surface mounted (screwed to the face of the door) with the included matching finish wood screws for easy installation. It is primarily used on cabinet doors, however it can also used on furniture doors, utility doors, pantry doors, any door or window where a colonial styled surface mounted lock is required. Colonial Design Cabinet Lock is in two parts, the thumb turn lock mechanism and strike box. By turning (rotating) the thumb turn knob you are locking them together. The classic colonial style and solid brass metal construction allows for years of durable continuous use, and is resistant to corrosion. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-CL1580_size.gif?v=1704354606\" width=\"366\" height=\"244\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana CL1580 cabinet lock size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/medium-size-colonial-cabinet-lock-deltana-cl1532\"><b>Medium Colonial  Style Cabinet Lock</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana CL1580 Cabinet Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Width: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Height: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Projection: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Box Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Box Height: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Throw: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CL1580.pdf?v=1691095315\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana CL1580 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Large Size Colonial Cabinet Lock | Deltana CL1580",
                "description": "Colonial Style Cabinet Lock, Deltana CL1580 - This cabinet latch is surface mounted (screwed to the face of the door) with the included matching finish wood screws for easy installation. It is primarily used on cabinet doors, however it can also used on furniture doors, utility doors, pantry doors, any door or window where a colonial styled surface mounted lock is required.  Colonial Design Cabinet Lock is in two parts, the thumb turn lock mechanism and strike box. By turning (rotating) the thumb turn knob you are locking them together. The classic colonial style and solid brass metal construction allows for years of durable continuous use, and is resistant to corrosion. ",
                "keywords": "DEL-CL1580 Colonial Style Cabinet Locks, Deltana  CL1580 1.6 x 2.3 Inch Solid Brass Cabinet Locks, cabinet latches, surface mounted cabinet locks, brass cabinet latches, Colonial style cabinet locks, Colonial door locks, brass cabinet door locks, pantry door locks, early american door locks, DEL-CL1580U3, DEL-CL1580U5, DEL-CL1580U10B, DEL-CL1580U15, DEL-CL1580U15A, DEL-CL1580U14, DEL-CL1580U26, DEL-CL1580U26D,"
